</div>
</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Collier’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$3.17m</strong>, taken from his <strong>$7.91m</strong> in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him.</p>
<p>He played one season at USC and Utah took him 29th in 2024, three months before he turned 20.</p>

