<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/isaiah-collier/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/isaiah-collier/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Are the Jazz Paying Isaiah Collier in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Collier earns $2.76m in 2026-27, fifteenth at Utah and the third year of his rookie contract. It rises from $2.64m last season. His career earnings come to $7.91m across three seasons, all at Utah. The salary is 1.51% of the club’s $182.97m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Isaiah Collier Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A club option covers 2027-28, with a deadline of November 2, 2026. If Utah exercises it he reaches restricted free agency in 2028 at 23."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Isaiah Collier Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $2.76m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Are the Terms of Isaiah Collier’s Contract?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Collier signed the rookie scale with Utah in 2024, four years and $12.9m, of which $7.91m is guaranteed. Utah exercised the option on this season on October 30, 2025. A second option covers 2027-28 with a November 2, 2026 deadline."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Isaiah Collier Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Collier’s net worth is estimated at around $3.17m, taken from his $7.91m in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him. He played one season at USC and Utah took him 29th in 2024, three months before he turned 20."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Isaiah Collier on a Rookie Contract?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Collier is paid $2.76m because the rookie scale pays by pick number, and the 29th pick is near the bottom of the first round."}}]}</script>
